<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-get-a-yield> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#label> "Get a yield" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-get-a-yield> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#comment> "Grow for both immediate and long-term rewards. A designer's discipline as much as a system property — listed under Hemenway's 'Principles Based on Attitudes.'" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
